# - Computer hostname is chosen and default is updated.
# - FileVault/FDE is enabled.
# - Homebrew is installed and available in PATH.
# - `rcm` is installed and available in PATH.
# - mise is installed and available in PATH.
# - mise has latest versions of node, ruby, python, etc. installed and set as default.
# - AI tools from third parties and local stuff like LM Studio are installed and configured.
# - iTerm2 shell integration is installed and configured.
# - iTerm2 color scheme is set.
# - Brave sync chain is set up.
# - GPG keys are instantiated and configured.
# - Command Line tools and/or XCode is installed and configured.

## Later
# - Homebrew packages are installed (e.g., via `brew bundle` and Brewfile)
# - `rcup` is run to symlink dotfiles into place.
# - Dotfiles are symlinked into place (e.g., via `script/bootstrap`).
# - MacOS defaults are set.
# - go, rust, and other language-specific version managers are installed and configured.
# - SSH keys are instantiated and configured.
# - 1Password CLI is installed and configured.
# - Starship prompt is installed and configured.
# - Tailscale is installed and configured.
# - Fonts are installed and configured.
# - Misc tools are installed and configured (e.g., fzf, tmux, etc.).
